# RAG System Rules

## Must

- Only retrieve published documents by default.
- Return citations with every generated answer.
- Keep chunk metadata rich enough for source display.
- Use hybrid retrieval: vector + full-text.
- State uncertainty when sources are insufficient.

## Must Not

- Do not answer from model memory for regulated business topics.
- Do not cite documents that were not retrieved.
- Do not silently include expired documents.
- Do not hardcode legal conclusions in code.

## Retrieval Contract

Each retrieved item must contain:

- document_id
- chunk_id
- document_title
- content
- score
- source_url
- metadata
